---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import {projects} from '../config';
---
<Base title="Projects"><div class="container page"><div class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</div><h1>Ideas, made <em>tangible.</em></h1><p>A collection of projects and experiments. These examples are placeholders, ready to be replaced with real work.</p></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.map((p,i)=><article class="project-card"><div class="project-top"><span>0{i+1} / SAMPLE PROJECT</span><span>✳</span></div>{p.screenshot?<img src={p.screenshot} alt={`Screenshot of ${p.name}`} loading="lazy"/>:<div class="project-visual"><span>{i===0?'⌘':'✳'}</span></div>}<h2>{p.name}</h2><p>{p.description}</p><div class="tags">{p.technologies.map(t=><span>{t}</span>)}</div><p><strong>Architecture:</strong> {p.architecture}</p><div class="project-links">{p.github && <a href={p.github}>GitHub ↗</a>}{p.demo && <a href={p.demo}>Live demo ↗</a>}</div></article>)}</div></div></Base>
